iger-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"HORSE AT EAST FORD, STRENGTH 38. SEEN: KITE HORSE.","cipher":null},{"seq":797,"t":5100,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1818,"retries":0},{"seq":798,"t":5100,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"My doctrine is to hold F1/F2 with foot/ele and use horse to hunt riders between them. I must reinforce F2 (Middle Ford) and secure F1 (West Ford) against Orchid's presence. Kite is advancing (W17), so I must be wary of northern pressure. Orchid is pressing F1 and F2. I will reinf"},{"seq":799,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c277","house":"rhino","letter":"L346","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":800,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c278","house":"rhino","letter":"L347","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":5100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":801,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c279","house":"rhino","letter":"L348","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5100,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":802,"t":5100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1720,"retries":0},{"seq":803,"t":5100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It's Watch 18. My doctrine is to offer Rhino a truce, then betray it. Rhino has a truce with me. I should use a letter to initiate the truce offer. I will position my forces to support this plan."},{"seq":804,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c280","house":"kite","letter":"L349","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":5400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":805,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c281","house":"kite","letter":"L350","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart